  <h2>Coasts</h2>

  <div class="topic">
    <h3>Erosion Processes</h3>
    <div class="card">
      <strong>Notes:</strong>
      <p>Coastal erosion includes hydraulic action, abrasion, attrition and solution.</p>

      <strong>Example:</strong>
      <p>Hydraulic action: waves force air into cracks, breaking rock apart.</p>

      <strong>Practice:</strong>
      <ol>
        <li>Name one erosion process.</li>
        <li>Which process involves rocks hitting cliffs?</li>
        <li>Which process dissolves rock?</li>
      </ol>

      <details>
        <summary>Show answers</summary>
        <ol>
          <li>Hydraulic action / abrasion / attrition / solution.</li>
          <li>Abrasion.</li>
          <li>Solution.</li>
        </ol>
      </details>
